# Title
## Sub *heading*

Plain text with `code`, **bold**, __bold2__, *italic*, _italic2_ and a [link](https://x.y/z).
Mixed: **bold *nested italic* text** and *italic **bold** inside*.
Edge: ``double `tick` code`` and ```triple``` and `unterminated
